 - Models in `app/models/account/data_transfer/`, `app/models/zip_file`
 
+## Translations
+
+Fizzy is translated in `config/locales/en.yml` and `config/locales/ja.yml`,
+generated from the dictionary in `script/i18n/translations.rb`. Strings are
+looked up by their English text (see `lib/translatable.rb`), so wrap user
+facing text — screen reader copy included — in `t("...")` and add the Japanese
+to the dictionary. Run `ruby script/i18n/build_locales.rb` after editing it, and
+`ruby script/i18n/check.rb` to find anything untranslated. See
+docs/translations.md.
+
 ## Coding style
 
 Before editing or reviewing code, read STYLE.md.
